{"passage": {"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-001", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "language": "ru", "level": "0+", "textType": "short_exchange", "title": "The Robot's Request", "body": "", "script": [{"speaker": "Покупатель", "voice": "female", "text": "Привет! Я хочу купить хлеб."}, {"speaker": "Продавец", "voice": "male", "text": "Хорошо. Вот хлеб. Это стоит 50 рублей."}, {"speaker": "Покупатель", "voice": "female", "text": "Спасибо. Вот деньги."}, {"speaker": "Продавец", "voice": "male", "text": "Спасибо. До свидания!"}], "source": "llm", "verified": false, "engine": "mistral-small3.2:24b-instruct-2506-q8_0", "drafted": "2026-10-01"}, "items": [{"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-001-q1", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "level": "0+", "type": "detail", "passageId": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-001", "stem": "What does the robot want to buy?", "choices": ["d. some bread", "c. a newspaper", "b. some milk", "a. a book"], "answer": 0, "explanation": "The robot says: 'Хочу купить хлеб.' This means 'I want to buy bread.' Therefore, the correct answer is d.", "source": "llm", "verified": false}], "check": null}
{"passage": {"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-002", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "language": "ru", "level": "0+", "textType": "short_exchange", "title": "The Trade Deal", "body": "", "script": [{"speaker": "Жена", "voice": "female", "text": "Ты знал, что новое торговое соглашение вступает в силу завтра?"}, {"speaker": "Муж", "voice": "male", "text": "Да, я читал об этом в новостях."}, {"speaker": "Жена", "voice": "female", "text": "Как ты думаешь, это повлияет на цены товаров?"}, {"speaker": "Муж", "voice": "male", "text": "Возможно, но мы увидим это в следующем месяце."}], "source": "llm", "verified": false, "engine": "mistral-small3.2:24b-instruct-2506-q8_0", "drafted": "2026-10-01"}, "items": [{"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-002-q1", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "level": "0+", "type": "detail", "passageId": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-002", "stem": "What does 'соглашение' mean here?", "choices": ["A kind of soup", "An agreement", "A type of fruit", "A type of dance"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "The correct answer is 'An agreement'. The word 'соглашение' means 'agreement' here, as it is used in the context of a trade deal. The text says, 'Новое соглашение о торговле', which translates to 'A new trade agreement'.", "source": "llm", "verified": false}, {"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-002-q2", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "level": "0+", "type": "main_idea", "passageId": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-002", "stem": "What is the main topic of the conversation?", "choices": ["A new trade agreement", "A sports event", "A vacation plan", "A new recipe"], "answer": 0, "explanation": "The correct answer is 'A new trade agreement'. The conversation revolves around the implementation of a new trade agreement, as indicated by the phrases 'Новое соглашение о торговле' and 'оно вступает в силу завтра'.", "source": "llm", "verified": false}], "check": null}
{"passage": {"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-003", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "language": "ru", "level": "0+", "textType": "short_exchange", "title": "The Grocery Bill", "body": "", "script": [{"speaker": "Покупатель", "voice": "male", "text": "Сколько стоит хлеб?"}, {"speaker": "Продавец", "voice": "female", "text": "Хлеб стоит сорок рублей."}, {"speaker": "Покупатель", "voice": "male", "text": "А сколько стоит молоко?"}, {"speaker": "Продавец", "voice": "female", "text": "Молоко стоит шестьдесят рублей."}], "source": "llm", "verified": false, "engine": "mistral-small3.2:24b-instruct-2506-q8_0", "drafted": "2026-10-01"}, "items": [{"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-003-q1", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "level": "0+", "type": "detail", "passageId": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-003", "stem": "What is the price of bread in the conversation?", "choices": ["30 rubles", "35 rubles", "40 rubles", "50 rubles"], "answer": 2, "explanation": "The price of bread is stated as 40 rubles in the conversation: \"Хлеб стоит сорок рублей\".", "source": "llm", "verified": false}, {"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-003-q2", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "level": "0+", "type": "main_idea", "passageId": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-003", "stem": "What is the main topic of the conversation?", "choices": ["The quality of the bread", "The price of groceries", "The location of the store", "The time of the purchase"], "answer": 1, "explanation": "The main topic of the conversation is the price of groceries, specifically the price of bread and milk.", "source": "llm", "verified": false}], "check": null}
{"passage": {"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-004", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "language": "ru", "level": "0+", "textType": "short_exchange", "title": "The Bus Drivers' Protest", "body": "", "script": [{"speaker": "Женщина", "voice": "female", "text": "Что происходит?"}, {"speaker": "Мужчина", "voice": "male", "text": "Водители автобусов бастуют."}, {"speaker": "Женщина", "voice": "female", "text": "Почему?"}, {"speaker": "Мужчина", "voice": "male", "text": "Они хотят большей заработной платы."}, {"speaker": "Женщина", "voice": "female", "text": "Когда они вернутся к работе?"}, {"speaker": "Мужчина", "voice": "male", "text": "Не знаю. Надеюсь, скоро."}], "source": "llm", "verified": false, "engine": "mistral-small3.2:24b-instruct-2506-q8_0", "drafted": "2026-10-01"}, "items": [{"id": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-004-q1", "exam": "DLPT_LISTENING", "level": "0+", "type": "detail", "passageId": "ru-dl-0p-short_exchange-004", "stem": "What does the male speaker say the bus drivers are doing?", "choices": ["They are asking for a pay raise.", "They are demanding new uniforms.", "They are requesting more vacation days.", "They are going on strike."], "answer": 3, "explanation": "The male speaker says \"Водители автобусов бастуют\", meaning 'The bus drivers are on strike.' This directly answers the question.", "source": "llm", "verified": false}], "check": null}
